      "writtenOn": "2026-06-22T11:05:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Your sanitize_and_prefix takes a std::string by value and returns a std::string by value. This is a great signature, but you are passing mf.name by copy. By using std::move(), you can recycle the memory already allocated inside the copied MetricFamily and avoid unnecessary string reallocations.",
